          verified visit fell between 20:00 and 05:00.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Sound:</strong> {{ d.hours.soundMorning }} of the {{ t.soundRecords }} records fell between 06:00
          and 10:00, and {{ d.hours.soundEvening }} in the single hour from 17:00, when the parakeets are loudest.
        </li>
        <li>
          <strong>Weather:</strong> the bowl was busiest in daylight hours between 22 and 26&nbsp;°C and quiet above
          26&nbsp;°C. But the warmest hours are also the middle of the day, and {{ d.period.daysWord }} days cannot
          separate the two. I claim no weather pattern.
        </li>
      </ul>
